# Generated image masters — hundreds of MB, and every one is reproducible from the
# prompt SHA-256 recorded in generated.json plus the batch definitions in
# scripts/brand-assets/. Keeping them out of the repo keeps clones small.
#
# The SHIPPED assets (frontend/assets/**, and the CDN copies) are what the app uses;
# these are the archived originals they were derived from.
*
!.gitignore
!generated.json
